/-
  Phys.Algebra.GeneratedModule — N4: THE GENERATED OPERATOR ALGEBRA + the MODULE
  (SPINOR) STRUCTURE the terminal algebra forces.
  ===========================================================================
  THE SECOND NODE OF THE ALGEBRA LAYER (depth 2), building DIRECTLY on N3
  (`Phys/Algebra/Operator.lean`). N3 derived — forward from the cascade — that the
  imaginary left-multiplications `Lop a : y ↦ a · y` of the octonion shape
  `CD (CD B)` satisfy, in the ASSOCIATIVE operator ring `AddMonoid.End (CD (CD B))`,
  the quadratic (Clifford) relation `Lop a * Lop b + Lop b * Lop a = − Lop (ι (bilin a b))`
  (`clifford_op`) and `Lop a * Lop a = − Lop (ι (Nrm a))` on imaginaries (`L_sq_op`),
  governed by the BANKED Born self-overlap `bilin` / `Nrm` (N2).

  This module reads off the SECOND purely-algebraic structure that forces:

